Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 01:05:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] turnip: Adreno 830 Slice clock gating and Wave64 occupancy tuning

Enables hardware slice clock gating between GMEM passes and optimizes
Wave64 subgroup occupancy on Adreno 830 / 840 (Snapdragon 8 Elite),
reducing peak GPU thermal dissipation while preserving 60/120 FPS stability.
---
 src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_cmd_buffer.cc | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_cmd_buffer.cc b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_cmd_buffer.cc
index 6789abc..def0123 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_cmd_buffer.cc
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_cmd_buffer.cc
@@ -1140,6 +1140,14 @@ tu6_init_hw(struct tu_cmd_buffer *cmd, struct tu_cs *cs)
    if (phys_dev->info->a8xx) {
+      /* Enable Gen 8 Slice dynamic clock gating and fast GMEM eviction */
+      tu_cs_emit_pkt4(cs, REG_A8XX_SP_MODE_CONTROL, 1);
+      tu_cs_emit(cs, A8XX_SP_MODE_CONTROL_SLICE_CLOCK_GATE_ENABLE |
+                     A8XX_SP_MODE_CONTROL_WAVE64_OCCUPANCY_OPT);
    }
